 conecta tu primer dispositivo","Obtén una identidad por EST, verifica su asociación y úsala en una conexión mTLS.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-53/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device",{"_62":215},"platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device.mdx",{"_38":217,"_45":56,"_40":218,"_50":219,"_59":-7,"_11":220,"_60":221},"es:platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device.mdx","Registra un dispositivo manualmente","Prepara un DMS, registra un dispositivo y asocia un certificado comprobado a su identidad.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-53/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device",{"_62":222},"platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device.mdx",{"_38":224,"_45":83,"_59":-7,"_40":225},"es:_6","Dispositivos e identidades",{"_38":227,"_45":56,"_40":225,"_50":228,"_59":-7,"_11":229,"_60":230},"es:platform/iot-fleets/device-management.mdx","Registra, inspecciona y retira dispositivos comprobando su identidad actual y su historial.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-53/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management",{"_62":231},"platform/iot-fleets/device-management.mdx",{"_45":46,"_40":233,"_47":-7,"_49":-7,"_50":-7,"_52":-7,"_42":234,"_38":291,"_60":292,"_59":294,"_197":295},"Enrolamiento con PKI",[235,242,249,256,263,270,277,284],{"_38":236,"_45":56,"_40":237,"_50":238,"_59":-7,"_11":239,"_60":240},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies.mdx","Estrategias de aprovisionamiento","Elige cómo se registra el dispositivo, quién autoriza su identidad y dónde se genera la clave.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-53/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies",{"_62":241},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies.mdx",{"_38":243,"_45":56,"_40":244,"_50":245,"_59":-7,"_11":246,"_60":247},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx","Configura y opera el DMS","Define registro, autenticación por operación, emisión, renovación y confianza distribuida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-53/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms",{"_62":248},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx"